CMD="aider"
MARKER="\n> "
VERSION_CMD="aider --version"
BUNDLE='du -sb ~/.local/share/uv/tools/aider-chat | cut -f1'
NOTE="aider.chat/install.sh (uv tool install, brings its own CPython). Model gpt-4o at 127.0.0.1:9; update check, analytics prompt, release notes and .gitignore prompt turned off in ~/.aider.conf.yml."
